OL,3,GNEWSAMissing sisters in video posted
OL,4,Abefore Nepal flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman desperate for news of two
OL,7,Fmissing family members says she saw
OL,8,Fthem in a TikTok video posted just
OL,9,Fhours before the Nepal flash flood hit.
OL,11,FTulshi Patel's mother, Hemangini
OL,12,FJitendra Patel, and her aunt, Hema
OL,13,FSunil Amin, were on a pilgrimage and
OL,14,Fhad planned to travel into Tibet, but
OL,15,Fare now among the thousands of people
OL,16,Funaccounted for.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
