OL,3,GNEWSAMissing sisters in video posted
OL,4,Abefore Nepal flood
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We did our own deep-dive research and
OL,7,Fwe found a TikTok video that verified
OL,8,Fand showed my mum and auntie and three
OL,9,Fother people from the tour at the
OL,10,Fborder waiting to cross, I guess, that
OL,11,Fthe local Nepalese tour guide had
OL,12,Fmade," she told radio station LBC.
OL,14,FThe pharmacist from Milton Keynes said
OL,15,Fthe journey had been on the pair's
OL,16,F"bucket list".
